{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I completed a reconciliation of invoices and shipment records after the latest quarter closed and found that the reseller underpaid exactly $186,400. The agreement's audit clause permits an audit when the reported royalty discrepancy is at least 5%, and the reconciliation shows a 7.8% discrepancy. Because 7.8% exceeds the 5% threshold, I believe we should exercise the audit right immediately rather than merely preserving it in reserve. I should note I haven't uploaded the reconciliation to the matter file yet because finance is still completing its month-end close."}
```

